  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The latest update broke the joint appearance of my avatar with mechanical arms, since the elbow joints are no longer uniaxial hinge.\nFortunately, we have been able to work around this by selecting LegacyIK for now.\nHowever, we do not believe it is correct for the wearer to switch the IK selection.\nSince this is a choice made for the convenience of the avatar design, I would like to see a parameter added that creators can set on the avatar SDK.\n\nFor example, \"[x] elbow joints as legacy(or hinge).\"",
